cff-version: 1.2.0
title: science2code-mcp
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jose
    family-names: Siqueira de Cerqueira
    email: jose.siqueiradecerqueira@tuni.fi
    affiliation: Tampere University
abstract: >-
  A local Model Context Protocol server that grounds coding agents in
  scientific papers. It verifies an agent's quote against the user's own held
  PDFs and returns either the paper's own characters with a locator, or a typed
  refusal naming which kind of refusal it is, with no language model in the
  loop. It never asserts whose claim a sentence carries.
keywords:
  - model-context-protocol
  - quote-verification
  - scientific-literature
  - grounding
  - citation
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.1.0
